i. my_array1[4][30] = 1'b1;
ii. my_array1[29][4] = 1'b1;
iii. my_array1[4] = 31'b1;
b. Draw my_array1 after the legal assignments are complete.

ANSWER :
a) i. my_array1[4][30] = 1'b1; --> is a legal
  ii. my_array1[29][4] = 1'b1; --> is a illegal
